<%#
  The mark at the top of a sign-in card: the service desk's logo when one is
  uploaded, the plain shape when not.

  One partial because there are eight of these pages - the address, the
  password, the code, Forgot password, the reset, Create an account, its
  confirmation and Choose a password - and only the first showed the logo.
  Somebody who had just seen their own branding then watched it vanish on
  the next step, which reads as a different site asking for the password:
  reported 16 Oct 2026.
-%>
<% if (locals.brandingLogo) { %>
  <img class="signin-logo" src="/branding/logo?v=<%= locals.brandingVersion %>"
       alt="<%= locals.appName %>">
<% } else { %>
  <span class="signin-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<% } %>
